	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"viewend", mode="off"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040100"},
		line=838,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Several days later─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Chihaya arrives at the palace on a summons from Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“What might this urgent matter be, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Allow me to put up a spellward before we begin.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"With a wave of Himi-no-Mikoto's hand, the presence of all those around us instantly vanishes.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Her magicks have ensconced the three of us in a world all our own.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“How very cautious of you.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“A matter such as this deserves no less.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"At this, Chihaya stands up a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Shiinoha Chihaya, you are not to speak a word of this matter to any other soul.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Can I trust you with this?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You may rest assured.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Chihaya unflinchingly regards Himi-no-Mikoto and offers a resolute answer.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Since her anointment as Exalt-Priestess, Chihaya has grown to an admirable extent.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She now wears the expression of one fit to serve as the supreme prelate of the faith.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Chihaya, my end will soon be upon me.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I-Is that truly so?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As a fellow priestess, you are surely well aware. The use of magicks inevitably consumes one's body.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Chihaya meekly nods her understanding.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have expended the full measure of my magicks in raising this Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This body of mine is at its limit.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“If you should pass away... whatever are the rest of us meant to do?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You needn't worry about that.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I merely intend to discard this worn body and be reborn in a new vessel.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I-Is such a thing truly possible?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“To receive life anew is to rewrite the most fundamental laws of nature!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis the nature of all magicks, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Indeed that is true, but even still...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“It is frightening to even imagine such an unthinkable feat.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The ritual will indeed be every bit as difficult as you are imagining.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I will conduct the ritual myself, but I shall entrust you to select the priestesses who will be assisting me.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I have long been resolved to offer even my life to you and Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Exercise the utmost discretion in fulfilling this duty.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The ritual will fail if any of the participants are distracted by even the slightest errant thought.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The occasion and site of the ritual, as well as the names of the participants are to be held to the highest secrecy.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Select only those with the tightest of lips and the most loyal of hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Your will shall be done.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Chihaya prostrates herself at Himi-no-Mikoto's feet.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have one further matter to ask of you.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Yes?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I wish for you to nominate a priestess who will carry a child on my behalf.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Y-You intend for them to birth a real child?!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto briefly explains the process of the ritual to a bewildered Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...That sounds like a most important role indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It will require a priestess of both strong body and healthy disposition.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Chihaya gulps audibly at this.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“How soon will you require the surrogate mother?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As soon as possible.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I am not long for this world, and the Crystal of Life has already been created.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto replies, tracing her hands over her own abdomen.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“D-D-Do you mean to say that... the child has already been c-conceived...?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“W-Well, I suppose so...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto steals a glance at me, a faint blush spreading across her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“U-Um, who might have been the sire?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Th-That's of no concern to you.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies!”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Chihaya immediately knocks her head against the floor.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In any case, you are to nominate a priestess capable of undertaking this most paramount responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Chihaya falls into silent contemplation.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The girl standing before me has not a trace of her usual carefree cheerfulness.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Her mouth drawn into a solemn line, she squeezes her eyes tightly shut, as though to dispel the hesitation clouding her heart.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I believe I have a person in mind...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...Might ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" be permitted to take on this responsibility?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You would volunteer yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I would.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Rather than lower her head, Chihaya meets\nHimi-no-Mikoto's steadfast gaze head-on.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"After several seconds, a faint smile begins to play across\nHimi-no-Mikoto's lips.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I could not ask for anyone worthier.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I gladly entrust my life to you.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I am honored beyond words.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Only then does Chihaya lower her forehead to the floor in a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"After arriving at an accord regarding the ritual, Himi-no-Mikoto asks me to accompany her to the hillside for the first time in a long while.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"The hill is by no means steep, but she still takes several rests before arriving at our destination.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Though she appears as dignified as ever in front of others, in truth, she has become terribly frail.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Phew... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ah, beautiful as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto takes mine arm, leaning herself against me.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Lately, she has taken to unreservedly linking our arms whenever we find ourselves alone together.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My end looms closer and closer with each passing day.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You will be reborn, will you not? This is no end, but rather, a new beginning.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"However, Himi-no-Mikoto remains silent.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you worried?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“No, not particularly.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I'd like to think I've become a bit less of a simpleton.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"After all, I can tell that she's lying right now.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Please, if there is anything at all that I may do for you, I ask that you tell me.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Several times, Himi-no-Mikoto appears on the verge of replying, only to bite her lip in hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I have kept it a secret thus far, but in truth, the reincarnation ritual requires one final, crucial step.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I must end my own life at the ritual site.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In order for my soul to be transferred to the newborn child, I must discard its current vessel.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto has to discard her existing body so that her soul can be transplanted in her new body.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I know nothing of magicks, but this sounds only natural.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Originally, I intended to complete the ritual by ending my life myself.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But now, Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If you are willing, I would ask you to be the one to claim my life.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You're asking me... to kill you?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"To do the unthinkable, and slay mine own creator?",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I will not compel you this time. The decision is all yours.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“B-But...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You needn't worry. I won't come back and haunt you for it.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto shows me a wry smile.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Lopping my head off ought be but a mere trifle for the likes of you, no?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You think this a trifling task?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“To ask me to kill you... to kill mine own lord...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“S-Sorry. That was wrong of me.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"We both avert our eyes at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"An awkward atmosphere descends upon the hillside.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Never mind.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This was always my responsibility from the start.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I apologize. Put it out of your mind.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto flops down on the grass beside me, as though to signal an end to the conversation.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"But is she really okay with this?",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"If she'd only ordered it of me, I would have unquestioningly obeyed─",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"─and claimed her life without any hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Instead, she must now take on the burden of ending her own life, all for the sake of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Where shall I find myself in that fateful hour?",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Standing helplessly aside as I watch her lay the blade on her own neck?",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"...I refuse to accept that.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"If Himi-no-Mikoto's death must come to pass, I insist on being right by her side until the very end.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Especially if mine presence might bring her comfort, if mine blade could ease her suffering...",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'll do it.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto sits up at this.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I will claim your life.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You'll really do it?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If anything, I should be asking this of you.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If you intend to end your own life, I ask you to grant me that privilege instead.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, allow me to claim your life... by mine own hand.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Even I cannot quite comprehend it.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Why does mine soul cry out to be involved with hers, in life and in death?",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Could this feeling be that which is called love?",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"If so, perhaps I have finally come a bit closer to possessing a human heart.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Thank you, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I could not imagine a more blissful end than to die by your hand.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm so sorry. It must be very hard for you.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The thought of leaving you to die alone is far more unbearable.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"A single peach petal drifts across the edge of mine vision.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"These petals of Persica are Himi-no-Mikoto's tears.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"One after another, they flutter down and gently bedight our surroundings in the image of her soul.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you crying?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm your Empress... I'd never cry.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto holds me tight in her embrace.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"A gentle warmth spreads across mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"A very different warmth than when we laid together.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You shall return all too soon. That's what it means to be reborn, is it not?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Yeah, that's right.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wait for me, Mitsurugi. I will stray from the mortal path if it means I can remain by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The sun slowly sinks beneath the twilit horizon.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"There is no sun that does not set.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"But neither is there any night that lasts forever.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"No matter how long I must wait, I shall surely see it rise again.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"It has been over nine months since I received the Crystal of Life, and my belly has now swollen as big as a watermelon.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Phew... phew... Aah, my belly is so heavy...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“How admirable all the mothers of the world truly are.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Setting my ungainly body in motion, I resume laying out the implements needed for the reincarnation ritual.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Tomorrow, the day of the ritual will be upon us at last.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I will need to finish the final preparations by then.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ehehee, you've gotten so big.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"I murmur as I gently stroke my belly.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"In order to preserve my body, I stepped down as Exalt-Priestess around half a year ago.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Around the time the bulge in my stomach was becoming too obvious to hide.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto-sama's reincarnation ritual may well be the best-kept secret in the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"As such, the fact that I am bearing a child must also be kept a secret.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"For the past six months, I've been living in a heavily warded room deep within the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mhm, everything is perfectly in its place.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Finishing my preparations, I pause to catch my breath.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"The ritual will be conducted right here tomorrow.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"And I will do my part by finally giving birth to the baby inside my belly.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ah... To think that I will become a mother without ever having lain with a man...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“How blessed you are, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"The Crystal of Life inside me was surely conceived by Himi-no-Mikoto-sama and Mitsurugi-sama's union.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"The two of them have apparently taken to acting much more openly intimate as of late.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“But I suppose that for Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, there was never any other choice.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"I cannot help but feel more than a little jealous of her.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"But I would never dream of allowing any other priestess the privilege of bearing her child.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Selfish as it may be, I cannot bear the thought of anyone else taking on this role.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The reason being that this child in my belly belongs just as much to Mitsurugi-sama...",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I hope you come out nice and healthy, my precious little baby.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I wonder what my first words to her should be?",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, but perhaps she will already have\nHimi-no-Mikoto-sama's soul inside her.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Instead of gooing and gaaing, her first words to me might very well be an imperious, “Thank you for your service.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hmm, I'm not sure how to feel about that...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"As I ponder such matters, one of the priestesses assisting with the ritual approaches the altar.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"She is one of the trusted priestesses I nominated from House Yagi.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess of Yagi"},
			{
"“Chihaya-sama, so this is where you were.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“What might be the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess of Yagi"},
			{
"“I come bearing a message from Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess of Yagi"},
			{
"“He wishes to speak to you in private before the commencement of the ritual.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Where might Mitsurugi-sama be at present?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess of Yagi"},
			{
"“He is waiting on you right outside the temple.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Priestess of Yagi"},
			{
"“He impressed upon me his desire to keep this a secret from Himi-no-Mikoto-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"To preserve the sanctity of the ritual site, those involved ought never cross its threshold once it has already been purified.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"But... a matter that must be kept secret from even Himi-no-Mikoto-sama?",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"It must surely be of great importance indeed.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I suppose I have no choice. Let us go.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
